# Transcript search: regex mode over synthetic user and assistant messages
Output tools/vhs/.render.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1500
Set Height 820
Set Padding 20

Hide
Type "sh tools/vhs/.demo/run.sh"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "4"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+R
Type "migration [0-9]{5}_[a-z_]+"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 2s
Screenshot assets/search.png
Sleep 1s
